<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>Does Anthropic profitability mean Claude will become cheaper?</h3><p>No. Profitability does not determine customer pricing by itself.</p><h3>Should enterprises rely on one AI provider?</h3><p>For critical workflows, keeping a tested fallback reduces vendor and outage risk.</p><h3>What is the best way to compare AI model costs?</h3><p>Measure cost per accepted task, including retries, tool calls and human review.</p>
